## 🔧 New Service Features

### Payment Service
```javascript
// Process payments with Stripe
await paymentService.createPaymentIntent(9.99, 'usd');
await paymentService.confirmPaymentIntent(intentId, paymentMethod);
await paymentService.createSubscription(customerId, priceId);
```

### Cache Service
```javascript
// Redis caching
await cacheService.set('user:1', userData, 3600);
const user = await cacheService.get('user:1');
await cacheService.delete('user:1');
```

### Push Notification Service
```javascript
// Firebase Cloud Messaging
await pushNotificationService.sendToDevice(token, notification);
await pushNotificationService.sendToTopic('chat', notification);
```

### Storage Service
```javascript
// AWS S3 file uploads
const url = await storageService.uploadFile(buffer, filename);
const imageUrl = await storageService.uploadImage(buffer, filename);
```

### Geolocation Service
```javascript
// Location-based features
const address = await geolocationService.geocodeAddress('New York');
const users = geolocationService.findUsersWithinRadius(location, users, 50);
```

### Search Service
```javascript
// Full-text search
const results = await searchService.searchUsers('john');
const messages = await searchService.searchMessages(userId, 'hello');
```

